      ],
      "source": "https://visithagerman.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Hagerman Fossil Beds National Monument preserves hundreds of fossil sites, including 20 complete horse skeletons.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
